# Git LFS — binary/large artifacts
# New files matching these patterns are stored as LFS pointers.
# NOTE: already-committed blobs are NOT retroactively converted; see docs/git-lfs.md.
# NOTE: .mlpackage internals must NEVER be LFS — Xcode's coremlcompiler needs
# real weight files to compile .mlpackage → .mlmodelc (last-match-wins below).
*.a        filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.bin      filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.pdiparams filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.pdmodel  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.mp4      filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.mlpackage/**/*.bin  !filter !diff !merge
**/*.mlpackage/**     !filter !diff !merge
